    "created_at": "2023-04-17T18:52:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-17T18:52:02Z",
    "body": "Hmm yeah if the bug is just that the popover's behavior is not matching the attribute value, there must be a way we can make sure that they are in sync.\r\nIn chromium we keep the auto/manual state in a separate place from the attribute itself, which the spec does not do, so this might not even be a spec bug. I'll try fixing it in chromium and report back here",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
