    "updated_at": "2023-04-17T19:15:17Z",
    "body": "I figured out how to fix it while still firing events by updating the not-specced copy of the attribute state in the case where we hide the popover and then bail due to the disconnectedness: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/4436269\r\n\r\nIf this patch is merged as-is, then no spec edits are required since the copy of the attribute state is not specced.",
